###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v2/book_now/bookings/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "team_name":"mnc",
  "phone":"9090909090",
  "turf":1,
  "booking_date":"2026-10-8",
  "booking_time":"16:00:00",
  "duration":"02:00:00"

}